sequenceDiagram
    participant Parent
    participant Daemon
    participant Child A
    participant Child B

    Child A->>Daemon: Turn complete
    Daemon->>Parent: SSE: task.completed
    Note over Parent: Reviews child work
    Parent->>Daemon: lazy accept child-a
    Daemon->>Daemon: Merge child-a into parent
    Daemon->>Child B: SSE: upstream.updated
    Note over Child B: Auto-syncs with parent
    Daemon->>Daemon: Auto-push parent branch
